1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,499
It all started on an ordinary morning.

2
00:00:03,749 --> 00:00:07,251
He was walking down the same alley, like every day...

3
00:00:07,401 --> 00:00:10,609
until his shadow... started walking ahead of him.

4
00:00:10,959 --> 00:00:15,673
It stopped under a balcony, turned around, and pointed at a flower pot.

5
00:00:16,023 --> 00:00:17,606
One second later...

6
00:00:18,756 --> 00:00:21,442
One more step... and he wouldn't be here.

7
00:00:21,692 --> 00:00:24,130
His shadow had just saved his life.

8
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,915
But this... was only the beginning.

9
00:00:33,565 --> 00:00:36,392
At first, he thought he was losing his mind.

10
00:00:36,742 --> 00:00:39,242
But the next morning, it happened again.

11
00:00:39,492 --> 00:00:43,193
His shadow was always exactly five seconds ahead.

12
00:00:43,443 --> 00:00:45,998
Whatever it did... he would do next.

13
00:00:46,948 --> 00:00:49,496
Which meant he always knew what was coming.

14
00:00:51,046 --> 00:00:52,694
So he started using it.

15
00:00:59,046 --> 00:01:01,003
He dodged speeding bikes...

16
00:01:06,453 --> 00:01:08,547
caught things before they hit him...

17
00:01:13,997 --> 00:01:16,913
and never, ever slipped on a banana peel.

18
00:01:18,063 --> 00:01:21,116
For the first time in his life, he felt lucky.

19
00:01:23,566 --> 00:01:26,179
Until one night, on his way home...

20
00:01:26,329 --> 00:01:29,703
his shadow did something it had never done before.

21
00:01:30,053 --> 00:01:33,131
It stopped. It looked back. And then... it ran.

22
00:01:33,481 --> 00:01:35,961
Not ahead of him. Away from him.

23
00:01:36,511 --> 00:01:40,483
Five seconds ahead meant it had already seen what was coming.

24
00:01:41,033 --> 00:01:44,652
So he did the only thing he could. He turned around.

25
00:01:45,402 --> 00:01:49,102
Under the streetlight behind him, stood another shadow.

26
00:01:50,652 --> 00:01:53,154
One that wasn't five seconds ahead...

27
00:01:54,252 --> 00:01:56,271
but five seconds behind.

28
00:01:57,021 --> 00:01:59,748
It had been following him his whole life.

29
00:02:00,298 --> 00:02:02,760
And tonight... it finally caught up.
